<title>USA: United HealthCare holder's suit dismissed.</title>
<headline>United HealthCare holder's suit dismissed.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>United HealthCare Corp said Wednesday a shareholder suit filed August 9, 1996 against the company was dismissed.</p>
<p>The suit, filed in U.S. District Court, District of Minnesota, had alleged securities fraud and other claims related to a decline in United HealthCare's stock price.</p>
<p>United HealthCare is a health care management provider.</p>
<p>		  ((-- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
